    {
      "id": "seg:heading:overview:0007:0001",
      "source": "Overview",
      "ko": "Overview",
      "sourceHash": "d4b1ea5708dd532930a85188b45aff6f0a3ed458500c7577e0127a538eb0d100",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "❗ **Important**: SceneKit is deprecated, use [`RealityKit`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/RealityKit) instead.",
      "ko": "❗ **중요**: SceneKit은 더 이상 사용되지 않으므로, [`RealityKit`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/RealityKit) 대신 사용해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9044504a22866fbaf6eeb024052984c17e12733b1d86ee7bd09de2ad5e9b014e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "For more information, see WWDC25 session 288: [`Bring your SceneKit projects to RealityKit`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2025/288/).",
      "ko": "자세한 내용은 WWDC25 세션 288: [`Bring your SceneKit projects to RealityKit`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2025/288/)를 참고할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9442b9482d96da8853cbe26d03a8eb01c9df8fef4c7af6b52bee8ee8fff413f7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "The [`ARSCNView`](arscnview.md) class provides an easy way to create augmented reality experiences that blend virtual 3D content with a device camera view of the real world.",
      "ko": "[`ARSCNView`](arscnview.md) 클래스는 가상 3D 콘텐츠를 실세계 카메라 뷰와 결합한 AR 경험을 손쉽게 생성할 수 있는 방법을 제공합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b340e6d05ebfde3969c0feeab8221b43cc89c58b8eb7ec7276bbc4ab39c7381d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0002",
      "source": "When you run the view’s provided [`ARSession`](arsession.md) object:",
      "ko": "뷰에서 제공되는 [`ARSession`](arsession.md) 객체를 실행하면:",
      "sourceHash": "a2eacadb624757549383ece9303f7af74f20befd27a490075a939b3d3341cb7d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0010:0001",
      "source": "The view automatically renders the live video feed from the device camera as the scene background.",
      "ko": "뷰는 장면 배경으로 장치 카메라의 실시간 비디오 피드를 자동으로 렌더링합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "421c4bde7352b9809ae232ce67e12aefd964387ae86d16ae6c60e86062a53d56",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0010:0002",
      "source": "The world coordinate system of the view’s SceneKit scene directly responds to the AR world coordinate system established by the session configuration.",
      "ko": "뷰의 SceneKit 장면의 월드 좌표계는 세션 구성에서 설정한 AR 월드 좌표계에 직접 반응합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7448891c5c3eacf15bfa7891deedbd5d356f483389d6041274899434ee12adf8",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0010:0003",
      "source": "The view automatically moves its SceneKit camera to match the real-world movement of the device.",
      "ko": "뷰는 장치의 실제 이동에 맞춰 SceneKit 카메라를 자동으로 이동합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4b8b7cdbb729189116a3b1af3384f826c0774ddaefc48592cbf9835b6c86a00e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0011:0001",
      "source": "ARKit automatically matches SceneKit’s coordinate space to the real world, so after you place your app’s virtual content, it maintains the illusion of resting in the real-world as the user moves the device.",
      "ko": "ARKit는 SceneKit의 좌표 공간을 실세계에 자동으로 정렬하므로, 앱의 가상 콘텐츠를 배치한 뒤에도 사용자가 장치를 이동할 때 실세계 위에 있는 것처럼 보이는 상태를 유지합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "5586e372e5ec8945f5195c4d6dd17aab57d018d375ade9f4fed30edbba834fc6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0011:0002",
      "source": "See [`Providing 3D Virtual Content with SceneKit`](providing-3d-virtual-content-with-scenekit.md).",
      "ko": "[`Providing 3D Virtual Content with SceneKit`](providing-3d-virtual-content-with-scenekit.md)를 참조하세요.",
      "sourceHash": "7eb0b1d638b993ca0e5a8679247859710fa0591e803f70cec6051c383ef23628",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0012:0001",
      "source": "You don’t necessarily need to use the [`ARAnchor`](aranchor.md) class to track positions of objects you add to the scene, but by implementing [`ARSCNViewDelegate`](arscnviewdelegate.md) methods, you can add SceneKit content to any anchors that are automatically detected by ARKit.",
      "ko": "씬에 추가한 객체의 위치를 추적하기 위해 반드시 [`ARAnchor`](aranchor.md) 클래스를 사용할 필요는 없지만, [`ARSCNViewDelegate`](arscnviewdelegate.md) 메서드를 구현하면 ARKit가 자동으로 감지한 앵커에 SceneKit 콘텐츠를 추가할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "23fdda35d5b9f54a72af7cebadb0329b48d573485aa366ca6f77910b2ae380f0",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0013:0001",
      "source": "Because ARKit requires Metal, use only Metal features of SceneKit.",
      "ko": "ARKit는 Metal이 필요하므로 SceneKit의 Metal 기능만 사용해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "fdcfcb68bb16d7a395790c9aa0e836c4053eb6342f8fbee32e67a8e7b25c78cc",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0013:0002",
      "source": "For example:",
      "ko": "예를 들어:",
      "sourceHash": "652744a2ab28954bbafd780fd76c15c2bd557594532f907f10ead1989727af95",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0014:0001",
      "source": "This class supports only [`SCNProgram`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNProgram) instances with Metal Shading Language code.",
      "ko": "이 클래스는 Metal Shading Language 코드가 포함된 [`SCNProgram`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNProgram) 인스턴스만 지원합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a5ea41e7f7174d64cfbc0dfda2a53632751fa2c2ac0516260219dc4bbb2465c2",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0014:0002",
      "source": "If you set the [`preferredRenderingAPI`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNView/Option/preferredRenderingAPI) property to [`SCNRenderingAPI.openGLES2`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNRenderingAPI/openGLES2), the framework reverts the value to  [`SCNRenderingAPI.metal`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNRenderingAPI/metal).",
      "ko": "[`preferredRenderingAPI`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNView/Option/preferredRenderingAPI) 속성을 [`SCNRenderingAPI.openGLES2`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNRenderingAPI/openGLES2)로 설정하면, 프레임워크는 값을 [`SCNRenderingAPI.metal`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNRenderingAPI/metal)로 되돌립니다.",
      "sourceHash": "36fed7e71351ca31d0c045956f342354d4439886aed92482ff5ac4fd26f6ba53",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
